[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_scene_resource.gd" id="1_scene"]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_line_resource.gd" id="2_line"]

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_0"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="祈祷从没有接线的旧收音机里传出来。没人碰它，调频旋钮却自己颤了一下。仓库管理员退到门边，手里还拿着没盖上的印泥盒。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["herald", "fletcher", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_1"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="herald"

speaker_name=""

text="第五队，下午好。你们带回来的那只箱子，是我们遗失的东西。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["herald", "fletcher", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_2"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="报身份和频道。这里是民用仓库。"

tone="resolve"

shot="wide"

motion="step"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["herald", "fletcher", "drayton"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "resolve"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_3"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="herald"

speaker_name=""

text="我们在寻找一位走散的客人。你们已经找到他，却还在给他披不合身的衣服。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["herald", "fletcher", "drayton"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "resolve"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_4"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="你在说我？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["herald", "fletcher", "drayton"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "resolve"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_5"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="收音机沉默了一会儿。你听见底噪里有一声呼吸，随后又想起这不该是能传声音的设备。帕金斯已经拔下天线，声音没有变化。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["herald", "fletcher", "drayton"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "resolve"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_6"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="herald"

speaker_name=""

text="你还记得门吗？门后的海很安静。你曾经希望所有人都能听见。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["herald", "fletcher", "drayton"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "resolve"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_7"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="我记不得。你说得再具体一点。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["herald", "fletcher", "drayton"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "resolve"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_8"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="herald"

speaker_name=""

text="他们让你失去了名字。我们可以还给你。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["herald", "fletcher", "drayton"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "resolve"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_9"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="真要还东西就留个领取地址。躲在收音机后面，连自己叫什么都不肯说？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["herald", "fletcher", "drayton"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "resolve"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_10"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="她把收音机转了个面，露出后盖一张褪色标签。标签上不是神的名字，是一个维修班组号，旁边贴着半张尚未兑付的食堂券。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["herald", "fletcher", "drayton"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "resolve"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_11"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="herald"

speaker_name=""

text="不是每个人都愿意听见真相。你的朋友尤其如此。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["herald", "fletcher", "drayton"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "resolve"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_12"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="你不知道我的朋友愿意听什么。把你控制的东西从仓库退出去，这里有平民。"

tone="resolve"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["herald", "fletcher", "drayton"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "resolve"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_13"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="外海接触在变。它们绕过巡逻灯，朝打捞区来了。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["herald", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "resolve"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_14"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="这些东西是你带来的？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["herald", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "resolve"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_15"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="herald"

speaker_name=""

text="我们只替它们清掉妨碍它们聆听的噪声。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["herald", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "resolve"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_16"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="弗莱彻压低声音，让仓库管理员先带人离开。她没有继续和收音机争辩。你忽然明白，让对方一直说话也是在给远处争时间，而你们已经没有多少。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["herald", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "resolve"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_17"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="箱子留下封存，净水膜先运走。第五队去外堤，我们不在住人的地方接这一仗。"

tone="resolve"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["herald", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "resolve"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_18"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="如果他说的名字是真的——"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["herald", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "resolve"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_19"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="回来再听。你今天不用拿港口换一个答案。"

tone="resolve"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["herald", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "resolve"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_20"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="收音机里又响起四次敲击。这次你把每一下都记住，没有跟着敲。德雷顿拽住你的袖子，拉你离开了那张桌子。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["herald", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "resolve"}

